 * @summary A shared host reset for the native `[popover]` surfaces (context-view, popover, tray) — strips the UA popover box so the inner styled surface controls its own look. `overflow` stays visible so a caret or shadow can escape the box.
 * @remarks Several web components (context-view, popover, and tray) import this same reset, so edits here reach every popover surface at once.
 * @compat Resets the native `[popover]` host box, so it targets browsers that support the Popover API.
 */
:host {
  margin: 0;
  border: 0;
  padding: 0;
  inset: auto;
  overflow: visible;
  background: transparent;
}

