  "# button",
  "",
  "A short description of the button component.",
  "",
  "CA",
  "",
  "## Usage",
  "",
  "Regular prose describing how to use the component.",
  "",
  "## Examples",
  "",
  "```html",
  '<div class="instui-button-group">',
  '  <button class="instui-button" aria-label="Primary">Primary</button>',
